[statement]
A dependency with a single candidate of a package installed for its
condition is installed at once, before names reached earlier: `lo`, the one
candidate for `Y`, is installed when `e` is, and answers `X`, which `z`
needed first, so `hi` is not installed. Contrast `a-dependency-with-two-
candidates-is-not-installed-at-once`.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:z base

P:base
V:1

P:z
V:1
D:X

P:e
V:1
i:base
D:Y

P:hi
V:1
k:100
p:X

P:lo
V:1
p:X Y=1

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install lo 1
install z 1
install base 1
install e 1
install top 1
